                                "example_id": "99ffb488-6879-49f7-bc4f-65b962d6ee04",
                                "sense_id": "6899d3ee-37b2-38a3-bc60-ec80fc23ddbf",
                                "text": "Die Betonung ist ein wesentlicher Bestandteil des Prozesses der Univerbation — zwei Worte verschmelzen und werden zu einem.",
                                "translation": "Stress plays a major part in the process of univerbation — two words fusing and becoming one.",
                                "english": "Stress plays a major part in the process of univerbation — two words fusing and becoming one."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0c0c4e5d-06a9-4020-b70a-0cfa3433fe3e",
                                "sense_id": "6899d3ee-37b2-38a3-bc60-ec80fc23ddbf",
                                "text": "Es kommen dazu noch Komposita als Produkte der Univerbation, des Ineinandergreifens von Ableitung und Komposition, Substantivierung und Komposition.",
                                "translation": "In addition, there are composita as products of univerbation, which is the intertwining of derivation and composition, substantivation and composition.",
                                "english": "In addition, there are composita as products of univerbation, which is the intertwining of derivation and composition, substantivation and composition."
